# --- application databases -------------------------------------
# PGAPP_<NAME>_PASSWORD provisions login role <name> + database <name> owned by
# it. See docker/_common/postgres/provision.sh.
#
# Empty since Forgejo moved to equestria (kubernetes/apps/forgejo). The file
# itself is kept rather than deleted: DockgeLxc copies `.env-local` verbatim
# when it is present, and removing it is a change to the postgres stack's own
# deploy shape rather than to its tenant list. The `forgejo` role and database
# it used to provision still exist on celestia's postgres and are now orphaned
# -- drop them by hand once the equestria instance is confirmed good.
